    - target: {fileID: 7039160760367902337, guid: 821f93444d8c5134292838c3b966c1ab, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '


        Standard bottle of wine weighs around 1.2 - 1.5 kg. The
        label tells you most of it. The estate, the region and the year have to match
        each other; fakes usually get one of them wrong.


        The one thing
        you can definitely say about prestigious wine - it is not magnetic...'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
